# Third-party test data

Implementation source is original Rust written from the cited specifications. No third-party cryptographic implementation source is included. The default core has no runtime dependencies. The optional rustls-provider feature depends on published rustls and its Rust dependencies; their source is not vendored here. Reference crates and ring are host dev-dependencies only.

Published fixtures contain synthetic test keys; no deployment keys are included.

Wycheproof JSON files are unmodified and distributed under Apache-2.0; see tests/data/wycheproof-LICENSE.

ACVP JSON files are unmodified NIST test fixtures. The National Institute of Standards and Technology is their source. Its complete software notice is preserved in tests/data/nist-LICENSE (extracted from the upstream README License section on 2026-10-11).

