Inline fixtures in tests/vectors.rs come from FIPS 180-4, SP 800-38D and RFCs 4231, 5869, 7748, 8032, 8439 and 3394. FIPS 197 AES fixtures are in src/aes.rs. Constants are mathematical parameters from their specifications, not copied library source.

Reference standards: FIPS 180-4, FIPS 197, FIPS 202, FIPS 203, SEC 1 v2.0, SEC 2 v2.0, SP 800-38D, RFCs 2104, 3394, 4231, 5869, 7748, 8017, 8032, 8439, 10024, 10042; OpenSSH PROTOCOL.chacha20poly1305 for the SSH cipher. The FIPS 203 potential-update sheet was checked; its two listed corrections concern a table index explanation and a comment, not algorithm changes.
